da1d646f8c3184c6fd14337171.mp4?t=1758690852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Master your chosen Rogueteer, each with a unique personality, playstyle, and signature moves. Unlock a rich talent tree and customizable mods to enhance your gameplay, while discovering their background story the more you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104410/extras/c432de2e3b66c6a7bc027b5f93ce73d1.avif?t=1758690852\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104410/extras/33fd8e1af6b66f11a0074b7888e0b1b9.poster.avif?t=1758690852\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104410/extras/33fd8e1af6b66f11a0074b7888e0b1b9.webm?t=1758690852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104410/extras/33fd8e1af6b66f11a0074b7888e0b1b9.mp4?t=1758690852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every run is unique, allowing for endless build possibilities. With each victory or defeat, you gain new insights and grow stronger. Finish each dive by collecting loot to craft powerful weapons and mods for your next challenge.</p>","developers":["Pew Pew Games"],"ext_user_account_notice":"LEVEL INFINITE PASS (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104410/f155cf9e3f920c748b0ba10e535d973b6b1b649a/header.jpg?t=1758690852","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cla